<div class="scroll" role="region" aria-label="Spatial grid; scroll horizontally on a narrow screen" tabindex="0"><svg viewBox="0 0 440 410" role="img" aria-labelledby="r57-spatial-title r57-spatial-desc"><desc id="r57-spatial-desc">An invented metre grid shows a radius750 circle centred on0,0, inside its bounding square. A at300,400 lies within the circle. D at700,700 lies inside the square but outside the circle, so exact distance rejects it. B at600,800 and C at0,1200 lie outside the square too.</desc>
